### Lỗi 8 — Dùng `double` cho tiền

```java
// ❌ SAI
double gia = 0.1, thue = 0.2;
System.out.println(gia + thue);        // 0.30000000000000004

double tong = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < 1_000_000; i++) tong += 0.01;
